The base model weights used by Sylph (Qwen3.5 series and other Qwen-family
models) are released by Alibaba Cloud under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Users receive the model weights under Apache 2.0 with full redistribution
rights as granted by that license. The Sylph Public Use License does NOT
and CANNOT override or restrict rights granted by Apache 2.0 for those weights.

Apache 2.0 grants irrevocable rights to use, reproduce, and distribute the
model weights (with attribution). Sylph's no-redistribution clause applies
ONLY to Sylph's original software (Component 1), not to the Apache 2.0
model weights.

The full text of the Apache License, Version 2.0 is available at:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
